  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Afghanistan Deportation Response Border Consortium Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan is facing an unprecedented humanitarian crisis with a very real risk of systemic collapse and human catastrophe. This humanitarian crisis is reversing many of the gains of the last 20 years, including around women&#x2019;s rights.  At the end of 2023, returnees from Pakistan arrived in Afghanistan through border crossings and the trend is expected to increase through 2024. Through this project, IOM is addressing the humanitarian needs of vulnerable undocumented Afghan migrants returning from Pakistan through operations at the reception centres on the border with Pakistan in Kandahar and Nangahar and their respective transit centres, and in the provinces of high return.</narrative>
  </description>
